  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"T\u0131ls\u0131m Be\u015Flisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131
    \"ters\" se\xE7tin.\n\nTers \xE7\u0131kt\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in \u015Fansl\u0131
    olunan kartlardan biriyle kar\u015F\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131yay\u0131z {{isim}}.
    Bu kart, s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 \xE7ok ucuz atlatt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
    birtak\u0131m u\u011Fursuzluk ve musibetlerin ucundan d\xF6nd\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC
    i\u015Faret ediyor. Stresli d\xF6nemler ya\u015Fam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Hayat\u0131n\u0131n
    ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na dair birtak\u0131m kayg\u0131lar\u0131n olmu\u015F. Gidi\u015Fata
    y\xF6n verememekten korkmu\u015F ve kendi i\xE7 d\xFCnyanda \xE7ok h\u0131zl\u0131
    tedbirler alm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Neyse ki kar\u015F\u0131na dikilen her t\xFCrl\xFC
    tehdidin \xFCstesinden ba\u015Far\u0131yla gelmi\u015F ve daha korunakl\u0131
    bir alana ge\xE7mi\u015Fsin. Sorunlar\u0131 kronikle\u015Fmeden \xE7\xF6zm\xFC\u015F,
    kaynaklar\u0131n\u0131 en do\u011Fru \u015Fekilde kullanm\u0131\u015F, insanlarla
    olan ili\u015Fkilerini en optimum d\xFCzeyde tutarak \xE7evrene kar\u015F\u0131
    harika konumlanm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Bu da sana sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve huzur getirmi\u015F."
